\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.10}{\ignorespaces Donor side of the persuasion app on a phone.}}{35}{figure.caption.24}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.11}{\ignorespaces Fundraiser overview: summary cards, AI-ranked ``most likely to donate'' list, donation-intent distribution, and recent conversations with intent badges.}}{35}{figure.caption.25}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.12}{\ignorespaces Fundraiser inbox. Left: conversation list with intent badges, unread counts, search, and filters. Centre: chat with strategy labels under each fundraiser message. Right: AI analysis panel with the intent gauge, predicted outcome and confidence, strategies used, intent timeline, and latest donor replies.}}{36}{figure.caption.26}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.13}{\ignorespaces Compact (1100\,px) layout: the AI analysis panel opens as a slide-over drawer instead of a fixed third pane.}}{36}{figure.caption.27}%
